{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:623","content":{"id":623,"title":"欧拉回路","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"47a4e0b9-67ec-4c81-8621-4f11c8324458","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"18世纪初普鲁士的哥尼斯堡，有一条河穿过，河上有两个小岛，有七座桥把两个岛与河岸联系起来，如下图(黄色线条代表桥，绿色区域代表小岛和河岸)"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2e0664dd-027d-4f55-b272-86a060633426.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2e0664dd-027d-4f55-b272-86a060633426.png","width":579.1666436526519,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fa03d3f7-b47a-4e53-8958-d6c8b3ccea9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8537c468-fe43-4454-975c-2e2c0f10e7b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有个人提出一个问题：一个步行者怎样才能不重复、不遗漏地一次走完七座桥，最后回到出发点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f1b187c1-17ac-43ad-8f64-a2c1fde4065b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数学家欧拉将河岸与小岛建模为节点，而七座桥建模为边，所以七桥问题建模为上图最右边的图论问题，找到图中经过所有边一次且回到原点的回路，这种回路我们后来称为欧拉回路。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"14868225-b366-4e1f-aa22-692e9a14e23a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"欧拉回路的数学性质"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41512925-2699-455a-9476-c4f7483d1b5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述的七桥问题很长时间都没有解决，即人们没有找到一条回路，能够只经过每座桥一次，然后回到原点。所以欧拉就猜想是不是根本不存在这种回路，经过他的证明，上述七桥问题的确不存在欧拉回路。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7df3e507-8ef4-4763-ae1b-981f07795db2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"欧拉证明十分的简单，因为要从起点出发回到原点，那么对于每个节点都要一进一出，而每次进出需要消耗两条边，所以每个节点必须具有偶数条边，它才能保证有进有出，才有可能回到原点。所以就得到了欧拉回路一个充分必要条件："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"ac7453b2-571b-41df-a953-bf3d53dc16e7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f79fb25f-b28f-4605-ab9e-2a976bf73868","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个节点的度都是偶数 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\Leftrightarrow","collabId":"fd836f46-c5d9-4542-849d-935799943d62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\Leftrightarrow"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 图中存在欧拉回路"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cca509ed-bbe6-45d8-ad2e-a3ade3d906ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个节点的度都是偶数是图中存在欧拉回路是充分必要条件，二者可以互推，所以我们只要判断图中每个节点的度是不是偶数即可得到图中是否有欧拉回路这个结论。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b5bb9a22-b125-40b9-bc72-37b448620827","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回到七桥问题，观察图中的每一个节点，发现它们的度都不是偶数，所以绝对不可能从某点出发，经过所以的边一次然后回到原点，至此欧拉完美的解决了七桥问题，图论领域也是从此开始发展。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2b65fb80-bf03-46d2-a5d1-36ab3244469a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是判断欧拉回路是否存在的代码："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"eeaccf42-8d34-4b82-96e0-43195316dfd6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ecefa42e-2fdf-4a6f-b720-c8fd68986791","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public class EulerCycle {\n    private Graph graph;\n\n    public EulerCycle(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n    }\n\n    public boolean hasEulerCycle() {\n\n        // 如果图中不只一个联通分量的话，说明肯定没有欧拉回路\n        CCGraph ccGraph = new CCGraph(graph);\n        if (ccGraph.getCCcount() != 1) {\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (graph.degree(i) % 2 != 0) {\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n}","collabId":"29b92a4b-da6c-40e0-9ad4-9ab62abfdaf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9fc55d01-9fa0-4117-a330-d54b2888a58c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"求解欧拉回路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"497aef3f-88dd-46bb-8d32-ca81fcee3627","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们只是判断图中欧拉回路是否存在，但是我们没有得到一个具体的欧拉回路，所以在本节中介绍三种方法得到欧拉回路。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a5bc8182-2ed8-4fe8-a34f-e4ef3c3dba36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回溯法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c9272a6-9000-4d32-bd54-166ef2b82743","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回溯法就是暴力搜索法，搜索从起点出发的所有路径，直到找到一条欧拉回路"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/105667919-3ef40c80-5f17-11eb-925c-8d26434d285c_6a6ab5e1-f6bc-40a4-afc8-0a748d1703ef.gif","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/105667919-3ef40c80-5f17-11eb-925c-8d26434d285c_6a6ab5e1-f6bc-40a4-afc8-0a748d1703ef.gif","width":579.9999769528716,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3e08691f-534f-43f8-9af9-2ea90cd18c1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b0d8cdcf-a25f-48fe-bcd3-ceb89979dab7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Fleury 算法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f934930-63fb-4115-bd6b-521cc591bd20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑下图，当我们从节点 0 来到节点 2 时"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_678f22d9-c805-41e7-93f9-e06ea7f14e4c.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_678f22d9-c805-41e7-93f9-e06ea7f14e4c.png","width":367.0833187467528,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"7e24979c-b476-4ffc-9f22-ca858d6d32ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90829954-1653-4caa-9d72-a865d5b1597f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于回溯法，可以选择遍历节点 1，也可以选择遍历节点 3，而 Fleury 算法却会选择接下来遍历节点 3 而不是节点 1，因为边 2-1 它是一个桥，如果选择遍历节点 1，就不可能再次回到节点 2，即节点 2 右边的边 2-3 2-4 不可能被访问到，所以 Fleury 算法的策略就是在遍历边前判断这条边是不是桥，如果是桥的话，就不遍历这条边，选择其他的边。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"daf3eec4-f2ac-47f1-a140-4a0c1a325151","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Hierholzer 算法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6bcb769e-9a6e-4dfd-89c3-ba116f2762db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑下图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b278dca6-a537-43ab-874f-8b17c966350c.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b278dca6-a537-43ab-874f-8b17c966350c.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"aceb811d-2572-4969-b7ac-79857fda1ff1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49b8a2d0-125d-49fd-bb73-9255351b4671","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上图每个节点的度都是偶数，所以该图一定有欧拉回路。Hierholzer 算法首先在图中随便找到一个环"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d47cf738-5879-487c-ab40-ed7e4c0d3244.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d47cf738-5879-487c-ab40-ed7e4c0d3244.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"affa13be-d6c3-4ee5-8905-d823ca0e98b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5ca9488e-2a38-4959-92d3-5100d013294d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个环如果是欧拉回路，那就找到了；如果不是欧拉回路，例如上面找到环 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0","collabId":"474ef65a-60f7-4c4d-a44e-3714b84edf67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它不是欧拉回路，中间缺失了一环，因为节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还与别的节点相连，上述链中的 $2$ 应该变为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 \\rightarrow \\cdots \\rightarrow 2","collabId":"72cf5ad6-32d1-4631-b340-bd32c1fa515f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 \\rightarrow \\cdots \\rightarrow 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们需要回退到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始寻找这个环。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c00f7892-bfe2-46f9-a5e4-1e02d0ccd240","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如我们继续找到了 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2","collabId":"cc8b7d08-05de-4987-8132-576e13dbd511","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个环"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a124f90-511c-4bdc-abed-4a72fa67d097.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a124f90-511c-4bdc-abed-4a72fa67d097.png","width":435.64089778542564,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2e690cd5-f506-4075-8087-e79e1d03b8ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c4df233b-9c16-46b5-9d4a-9b45e9d1f182","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是因为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5","collabId":"dab71c26-d289-4960-b347-2462b82a5441","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还与别的节点相连，所以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5","collabId":"13785c40-14e6-480f-99fb-8adc7d868889","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 应该被扩展为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5 \\rightarrow ... \\rightarrow 5","collabId":"b616159d-c690-42d0-aedb-33e74f338b6c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5 \\rightarrow ... \\rightarrow 5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以又需要回退到节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5","collabId":"a3437ac0-3103-429a-a077-59dc36884584","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开始寻找新的环"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0c2d48a4-ff60-4164-b0b7-0b2ecfb0377b.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0c2d48a4-ff60-4164-b0b7-0b2ecfb0377b.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"81d8ca76-3f5d-4f0d-b6c2-e8e78e97a95b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d5fe2715-dfec-499e-a892-8c4bb1c76a57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最终我们找到了环 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5","collabId":"9e5af640-ef34-482b-9cec-3a5cd4a8915b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将这个结果替换 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2","collabId":"d33db7c3-7e90-4b92-b006-7761d30effb8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 其中的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5","collabId":"916240b5-34d3-4fd1-8a6a-c30829bfce9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，得到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2","collabId":"31c0b7bb-2190-4ddc-b42d-0ffa9c4f5751","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，最后将这个结果环替换  "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0","collabId":"75e74857-b8f5-4c17-9b45-42940fa29bb7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 其中的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"10d5990c-78b9-468a-b7ff-c6839f8bc077","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，结果变为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0","collabId":"8c7d9d5c-bc9d-40d8-81a7-074dda716c9c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 \\rightarrow 1 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 4 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 6 \\rightarrow 7 \\rightarrow 8 \\rightarrow 5 \\rightarrow 2 \\rightarrow 3 \\rightarrow 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"482bd164-41df-4385-a35a-4ab61d4f1f12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以使用栈来模拟上面的回退动作，当我们遍历环时，将节点添加进栈 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"result"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，当我们发现来到某个节点不能继续遍历并且还有边未被遍历时，我们便进行回退，从栈中弹出元素，直到栈顶节点还与其他节点相连，从该节点开始寻找新的环。我们会将从栈中弹出的节点添加到另一个栈 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"back"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，当我们遍历完所有的边时在将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"back"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个栈中的节点依次弹入到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"result"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个栈中"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/105673883-a6af5500-5f21-11eb-8ebb-6308b66a5715_c9634d49-f073-404c-9006-c63ac5d73b07.gif","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/105673883-a6af5500-5f21-11eb-8ebb-6308b66a5715_c9634d49-f073-404c-9006-c63ac5d73b07.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f6590ad5-8e93-48a6-b068-e8f7084a2ca1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15b23476-bf31-4884-b2fc-2a40e7ed2caa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为上面有删边的动作，所以我们在 Graph 接口添加了一个 removeEdge(int v, int w)，作用就是将 v-w 这条边删除，具体实现如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"9e7f543e-a514-4f6c-abc7-f2dfbeb1e3ad","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3e1eb647-d720-43d0-b010-1b6016a0bb18","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"@Override\npublic void removeEdge(int v, int w) {\n    validateVertex(v);\n    validateVertex(w);\n    sets[v].remove(w);\n    sets[w].remove(v);\n}","collabId":"1be2ee2d-7c1a-4643-87e8-bbc9069b0187","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3990a5a4-9f2e-4442-8b1f-f2b8e541b1c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Hierholzer 算法的实现如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"6e52aba9-2d3d-47ca-820e-c9bb7e80fa6d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"21b37b4e-3f65-42d5-9f81-733634da1705","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Collections;\nimport java.util.Stack;\n\npublic class EulerCycle {\n    private Graph graph;\n\n    public EulerCycle(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n    }\n\n    public boolean hasEulerCycle() {\n\n        CCGraph ccGraph = new CCGraph(graph);\n        if (ccGraph.getCCcount() != 1) {\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (graph.degree(i) % 2 != 0) {\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    public Iterable<Integer> result() {\n        ArrayList res = new ArrayList();\n        if (!hasEulerCycle()) return res;\n\n        // 剩余未被遍历的边数\n        int left = graph.E();\n        Stack<Integer> result = new Stack<>();\n        Stack<Integer> back = new Stack<>();\n\n        int curV = 0;\n        result.push(curV);\n        // 还有边未被遍历就继续遍历\n        while (left != 0) {\n            // 每次更新 curV 为栈顶节点\n            curV = result.peek();\n            // 如果栈顶元素有相邻节点，从此寻找新的环\n            if (graph.degree(curV) != 0) {\n                // 获得一个相邻节点\n                int w = graph.adj(curV).iterator().next();\n                result.push(w);\n                graph.removeEdge(curV, w);\n                left--;\n            } else {\n                // 没有相邻节点，进行回溯\n                back.push(result.pop());\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 将 back 栈中的数据依次弹出到 result\n        while (!back.isEmpty()) {\n            result.push(back.pop());\n        }\n\n        // 将栈中元素弹出到 list 中\n        while (!result.isEmpty()) {\n            res.add(result.pop());\n        }\n\n        Collections.reverse(res);\n        return res;\n    }\n}","collabId":"4e3db206-e0f0-420c-856e-9b602237e951","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"17f1d77a-a9b0-4f9f-a6af-d0ccd8fa58b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"验证算法是否正确，新建 g11.txt，内容如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"0ef33667-42f9-4799-a311-b56a859d561e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2ce8fd36-f2c2-407b-ab6c-352d0753d4fb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"9 11\n0 1\n0 3\n1 2\n2 3\n2 4\n2 5\n4 5\n5 6\n5 8\n6 7\n7 8","collabId":"184ba33d-bb8b-4bb2-aa5c-baba5020097c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0dbacf7a-202c-42b3-afd6-408d4e5f9b88","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所表示的图就是示例中的图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b278dca6-a537-43ab-874f-8b17c966350c.png","previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b278dca6-a537-43ab-874f-8b17c966350c.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0ad56a04-7ff0-4df6-977a-abded7001357","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19d1d113-607b-4861-8341-ae2d6fda82cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"测试如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b2889670-c610-4161-b9f2-4f70739049b3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ef1d62e5-3d68-4a4c-82f3-0e54264c5215","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Graph graph = new AdjSet(\"g11.txt\");\n    EulerCycle eulerCycle = new EulerCycle(graph);\n    for (int w: eulerCycle.result()) {\n        System.out.print(w + \" \");\n    }\n}","collabId":"b354a95d-4718-47a9-981f-041696e00cca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"42facc93-2649-4ac2-b501-b2049a0c0b03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"85e2a7ab-034f-44a9-981c-fe90f823dff7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"10e17db4-dae1-4d93-aa93-e163b36f6a26","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"0 1 2 4 5 6 7 8 5 2 3 0 ","collabId":"12ad4e0f-910f-4afc-a9de-2fd92522c5f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b4972e6-8750-4d29-a3ed-91a0e154059d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与我们讨论的结果一致。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"欧拉回路","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:623","type":"doc","id":623}}],"prevPage":{"title":"不同路径","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:622","type":"doc","id":622}},"nextPage":{"title":"最小生成树","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:624","type":"doc","id":624}},"createTime":1702087613168,"updateTime":1788606188286,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1788606188286}}